HUHtLaddU3q3hV4qF46bkzYB.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"en-US","title":"Private Tutor to the Duke's Daughter","overview":"After Allen failed the court sorcerer exam, he couldn't return home even if he wanted to. While searching for a job, an unexpected offer comes his way to be the private tutor of the duke's daughter. Just as he lowers his guard, he faces a girl who can't use magic at all! But what is preventing her magic from working? Allen's unconventional lessons gently shine a light on the girl's future."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"——王宮魔法士の試験に落ちてしまった。世の中は厳しい。実家に帰ろうにも、先立つものがない。仕事を探すアレンに舞い込んだのは、公爵家御息女、すなわち公女殿下の家庭教師の仕事。どうも胡散臭いが、あの『腐れ縁』ほど大変な生徒じゃないだろう。そう高を括っていた矢先、彼を待っていたのは魔法を一切使うことができない少女だった？！彼女の魔法を妨げているものとは一体…？アレンの常識を覆す授業が、少女の未来をやさしく照らす——。","tagline":"先生は、私に『魔法』をくれました"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eafsvgIERpt9pfFbbDe70YlsTeo.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eafsvgIERpt9pfFbbDe70YlsTeo.png","language":"en","width":639,"height":357},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tY3CCq7yvQLOp3OyZnJVHLBtati.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tY3CCq7yvQLOp3OyZnJVHLBtati.png","language":"en","width":639,"height":357},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1XC96LZNSXnZzkwkuSb9Yi2dUDS.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1XC96LZNSXnZzkwkuSb9Yi2dUDS.png","language":"ja","width":620,"height":148}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/goM5LPOAKJDvf2BPWYqoPgbcb7B.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/goM5LPOAKJDvf2BPWYqoPgbcb7B.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2v5Pu4nsk9KyHbk8KrErrnEpJPh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2v5Pu4nsk9KyHbk8KrErrnEpJPh.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org